    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Game Features: \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Many puzzle-solving props\u3011\ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Many props for dealing with monsters\u3011\ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Resource management\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Escape Room\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Safe house\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Running training\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Salute to Classic Games\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You received a strange phone call from someone whose voice sounded odd. He called himself Uncle Jimmy and challenged you. You quickly accepted the challenge because you are a brave person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving at the location, you passed out. As your consciousness slowly returned, the only thing you could hear was the lingering melody of &quot;Clair de Lune&quot; in your ears. The place was a red building, with little decoration \u2014 more like a temporary structure. You were like a little white mouse, searching around inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight minutes later, you heard an alarm and felt instinctively that something bad was happening.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.poster.avif?t=1752487368\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.webm?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.mp4?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damn Uncle Jimmy will disturb you while you're searching for items. You need to use special tools to confront him. Read the texts you find carefully \u2014 they will be very helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the space in your backpack. Solve all the puzzles and find the final key. Your heart is beating faster and faster. You must survive and escape from here to win.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.poster.avif?t=1752487368\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.webm?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.mp4?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Game Features: \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Many puzzle-solving props\u3011\ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Many props for dealing with monsters\u3011\ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Resource management\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Escape Room\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Safe house\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Running training\u3011 \ufeff </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Salute to Classic Games\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You received a strange phone call from someone whose voice sounded odd. He called himself Uncle Jimmy and challenged you. You quickly accepted the challenge because you are a brave person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving at the location, you passed out. As your consciousness slowly returned, the only thing you could hear was the lingering melody of &quot;Clair de Lune&quot; in your ears. The place was a red building, with little decoration \u2014 more like a temporary structure. You were like a little white mouse, searching around inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight minutes later, you heard an alarm and felt instinctively that something bad was happening.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.poster.avif?t=1752487368\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.webm?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/67ff7c5a33aeb20106eaf4a24d45ac66.mp4?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damn Uncle Jimmy will disturb you while you're searching for items. You need to use special tools to confront him. Read the texts you find carefully \u2014 they will be very helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the space in your backpack. Solve all the puzzles and find the final key. Your heart is beating faster and faster. You must survive and escape from here to win.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.poster.avif?t=1752487368\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.webm?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795560/extras/64f74a5382fd7fb704b3aeeff514531e.mp4?t=1752487368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "This is an exciting escape room game. Uncle Jimmy has challenged you and invited you to his house to play a game. Let\u2019s see who can survive until the end \u2014 whether you escape alive first or get mercilessly killed by him. Hurry and find the puzzle-solving items to escape from this house!",
